It is rendered to PNG without changing the symbol or its colors. Termix's name
and logo identify the included software; no trademark rights are claimed.

Modifications made by this integration:
- Supervisor ingress URL discovery and removal of Supervisor credentials before startup.
- Persistent data relocation to /data/termix.
- Same-origin iframe policy and connection-based ingress IP restrictions.
- Adaptation of the frontend desktop-auth iframe detection.
- Renaming of adapted frontend modules to avoid stale browser caches.

Upstream entrypoint, nginx templates and adapted JavaScript modules are modified
at startup. Original templates are retained in /usr/local/share/termix.
The upstream source is available at the versioned URL above; integration source:
https://github.com/adrianoamalfi/hassos-addons/tree/main/termix

